# Dev-only mock engine and its fixtures. Nothing under src/ imports them, so
# `next build` never bundles them, and the runtime image (which copies only
# .next/standalone, .next/static and public) never sees them either. Excluded
# so ~700KB of fixtures stays out of the build context.
